    description: "WHAT\nThe Django view-template linker's _language_for_extension labels .txt, .xml and .djinja templates html: on the language axis, but not the file's language.\n\nREPRO\n~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v20_11242026/standins/linker_repro_base.txt, the t5.txt line (standins agent).\n\nNOT CHECKED\nWhether a template stand-in's language should follow the taxonomy's answer for the file (get_language) in every view-template linker, now that seven template languages are registered (PR #2370). Also not checked by anyone: the extensions registered there collide with other uses (.ftl is also Mozilla Fluent's, .vm and .j2 have non-template uses); an Ansible roles tree gained 301 jinja file nodes.\n\nFound 2026-11-24 while building PR #2370 (stable-id v20). Detail: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v20_11242026/STATUS.md and the package RESULTS.md named above."  # d899
